From: YJuDeAd <robinrashi@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 01:13:52 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 43/49] feat(parity): apply reference patches 0045-0048 and
 parity KEEP items

# Conflicts:
#	libs/spurs/cellSpurs.c
#	libs/system/cellSaveData.c
#	runtime/spu/spu_channels.c
#	runtime/spu/spurs_job.c
---
 libs/spurs/cellSpurs.c          | 62 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++------
 libs/system/cellSaveData.c      |  4 +--
 libs/video/cellGcmSys.c         |  9 ++++-
 runtime/ppu/tests/boot_main.cpp |  2 ++
 runtime/spu/spu_channels.c      |  2 +-
 runtime/spu/spu_context.h       |  7 ++++
 runtime/spu/spurs_job.c         |  5 +--
